editor_description = "PREP pilot card (five per team in a row, seat order). Width comes from the row (expand), height = content. Own team: SeasonPilotCard part (trust ring / level pill; gauges hidden). Opponent: EnemyTop (portrait at the same spot), red Warn chip when the analyst flags the pilot. Both: stat total (big). No name / role / mech labels (2026-10). Tap = pressed(pilot_id)."
